        <mxCell id="scd2-note" value="&lt;b&gt;SCD2 Versioning — same customer_id, two rows in the table:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#DC2626&quot;&gt;EXPIRED row:&lt;/font&gt;  surrogate_key=1, address=&quot;123 Main St&quot;, eff_end_date=&quot;2025-09-29&quot;, is_current=&lt;b&gt;false&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#15803D&quot;&gt;ACTIVE row:&lt;/font&gt;   surrogate_key=6, address=&quot;88 Rainier Ave&quot;, eff_end_date=&quot;9999-12-31&quot;, is_current=&lt;b&gt;true&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Point-in-time query:  WHERE eff_start_date &amp;lt;= :date  AND  eff_end_date &amp;gt;= :date  →  always returns one row."
          style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=12;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;rounded=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;"
